		{
			description: [
				"&9&lHostile Neural Networks.&r Kill a mob once, and then farm it forever without ever seeing another one."
				""
				"&7A void island has no biomes, no structures and almost nowhere for mobs to spawn. This mod sidesteps the entire problem: train a &fData Model&7 by killing a mob while carrying it, then run that model in a &fSimulation Chamber&7 to produce that mob's drops on demand.&r"
				""
				"&e&lThe loop:&r &7train the model &8→&7 simulate it &8→&7 get Predictions &8→&7 fabricate the exact drop you want&r."
				""
				"&8Everything here runs on Forge Energy and everything automates. It is the most reliable drop source in the pack."
			]
			icon: "hostilenetworks:sim_chamber"
			id: "7C00000000000001"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7C01000000000001"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7Farm mobs that cannot spawn"
