				"&9Hostile Neural Networks&r farms mobs without a mob farm. Put a blank Data Model in a &eDeep Learner&r, hold it while you kill that mob, and the model learns."
				""
				"Train a Wither Skeleton, a Blaze, an Enderman - anything you would rather not hunt by hand."
