			description: [
				"The &eSimulation Chamber&r runs a trained model over and over, on power, forever. The &eLoot Fabricator&r turns its predictions into the real drops."
				""
				"Wither skulls, ender pearls, blaze rods, gunpowder - on tap, while you sleep. Your mob problem is now a mob subscription."
