		{
			dependencies: ["210300000000000E"]
			description: [
				"The &9Merger Camera&r from Extra Hostile Neural Networks combines &l4 data models into 1&r."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the fix for the worst part of the mod:&r taking a model from Faulty to Self-Aware means hundreds of kills. Run four models in parallel - four Simulation Chambers, four sets of progress - then merge them."
				""
				"&7Fewer chambers cluttering the farm, and far less waiting for one model to crawl up alone.&r"
			]
			icon: "extrahnn:merger_camera"
