		{
			dependencies: ["7C00000000000001"]
			description: [
				"The &eDeep Learner&r holds up to four Data Models and trains them while you fight."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the whole mod in one item.&r Put a model in the Learner, hold or wear it, and every kill of that mob feeds the model. When it reaches the next tier it produces better output in the Simulation Chamber."
				""
				"&e&lThe tier ladder:&r &7Faulty &8→ &7Basic &8→ &7Advanced &8→ &7Superior &8→ &7Self Aware&r. Each tier needs more kills than the last, and yields more predictions per simulation."
				""
				"&c&lIn a void world this is how you farm mobs you cannot spawn.&r No overworld, no biomes, no structures - but a model trained once produces that mob's drops forever. Blaze, Wither Skeleton, Enderman, all of it."
				""
				"&7Kills only count while the model is in a Deep Learner you are carrying. Killing things with the model in a chest teaches it nothing.&r"
			]
			icon: "hostilenetworks:deep_learner"
			id: "7C00000000000002"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7C01000000000002"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Wear your models to train them"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7C02000000000200"
				item: "hostilenetworks:deep_learner"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&bThe Deep Learner"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7C00000000000002"]
			description: [
				"A &eBlank Data Model&r becomes a mob-specific model the first time you kill that mob while carrying it in a Deep Learner."
				""
				"&e&lChoose deliberately.&r A model is locked to whatever you killed first, so do not walk into a zombie with a blank model in your Learner unless zombies are what you wanted."
				""
				"&e&lThe models worth making early:&r"
				"&7- &fBlaze&7 - rods, and you have no Nether fortress"
				"&7- &fEnderman&7 - pearls, which AE2 and Ender IO both eat"
				"&7- &fWither Skeleton&7 - skulls, so the Wither becomes repeatable"
				"&7- &fGuardian / Shulker&7 - drops with no other source on an island"
				""
				"&8Blanks are cheap. Make several and train them in parallel across multiple Deep Learners."
			]
			icon: "hostilenetworks:blank_data_model"
			id: "7C00000000000003"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7C01000000000003"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7One per mob you want to farm"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7C02000000000300"
