			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7C00000000000004"]
			description: [
				"The &eLoot Fabricator&r converts Predictions into that mob's actual drops - and you choose which drop."
				""
				"&e&lThat last part is the point.&r A real mob farm gives you whatever the loot table rolls. This gives you exactly the drop you selected, every time. Want only blaze rods and never blaze powder? Set it and walk away."
				""
				"&e&lThe full loop:&r"
				"&7Deep Learner trains model &8→&7 Sim Chamber + matrix &8→&7 Prediction &8→&7 Loot Fabricator &8→&7 chosen drop&r"
				""
				"&7Every stage takes FE and every stage automates. Once built, this is the most reliable drop source in the pack - no spawn conditions, no light levels, no platform.&r"
			]
			icon: "hostilenetworks:loot_fabricator"
