		{
			dependencies: ["7C00000000000004"]
			description: [
				"Beyond mob drops, the chamber produces &eOverworld&r, &eNether&r, &eEnd&r and &eTwilight Predictions&r - dimensional loot tables rather than a single mob's drops."
				""
				"&e&lThree predictions matter here&r - Overworld, Nether and End. Each one turns a tuned data model into that dimension's ordinary mob drops, on your island, without the trip."
				""
				"&8A Twilight prediction also exists in the item list. Ignore it - Twilight Forest is not installed in this pack, so it has nothing to produce."
				""
				"&7Each dimensional prediction rolls from that dimension's general loot rather than giving a chosen item, so treat them as bulk supply rather than targeted farming.&r"
			]
			icon: "hostilenetworks:nether_prediction"
