			description: [
				"&eExtra HNN&r's &7Merger Camera&r combines four data models of the same mob into a single higher-tier model."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the answer to Simulation Chamber sprawl.&r Rather than running eight chambers on eight half-trained models, merge them and run two chambers on fully-trained ones. Same output, a quarter of the blocks ticking."
				""
				"&7That matters on this server specifically - every chamber is a block ticking constantly, and the standing rule here is nothing that slows the machine down.&r"
				""
				"&8Extra HNN also adds the Ultimate Loot Fabricator, which processes far more predictions per operation than the base version."
