			description: [
				"&9&lA Self Aware model is the ceiling&r - maximum prediction yield per simulation, and the point at which a single model out-produces most conventional farms."
				""
				"&7Getting there is a grind of kills, which is exactly what the Deep Learner is for: it trains passively while you do everything else. Wear one permanently and your models level themselves while you mine, build and fight.&r"
				""
				"&8Between this and Mystical Agriculture, a void island can produce essentially every material in the game without a single spawner."
